        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{10}$",
          "worked": "Of the 20 multiples of 5, exclude the 10 multiples of 10.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(B)&=\\frac{20-10}{100}\\\\P(B)&=\\frac{1}{10}.\\end{align*}$$",
